// title: Smoke Sandstorm - SnailResin and SlugResin Infection Detection · Microsoft Defender Antivirus Detections
// date: 2026-10-21
// product: Defender XDR
// tables: AlertInfo
// purpose: SlugResin infection involves the use of a legitimate file to load a malicious binary through DLL search order hijacking, delivering the SlugResin backdoor onto the target's device. This backdoor grants the actor access to the compromised device, potentially leading to further malicious activities li
// source: https://github.com/Bert-JanP/Hunting-Queries-Detection-Rules/blob/65d11700e1cb878403d87312acdd6b9a8dd622c1/Defender%20For%20Endpoint/nf_ttp_smoke-sandstorm_unusual_coreuicomponent.dll-behaviour.md
// kind: repo
// author: Bert-Jan Pals
